// - Vec3 "copy" sites use `vec3(v[0], v[1], v[2])`; `Vec3` is a mutable
//   `Float32Array` so a bare `=` would alias instead of copy, matching
//   g_turret.ts's/m_gladiator.ts's own established idiom.
// - `self.enemy` (nullable in `EdictT`) is narrowed via an explicit
//   `if (self.enemy === null) return` guard rather than a non-null
//   assertion -- no casts anywhere in this file besides `as const`.
// - `st`/`spawn_temp_t` is the real, shared singleton imported from the
//   landed g_spawn.ts (not a per-file duplicate).

